# Insurance claim.
#
# Lodge the claim, then verify the policyholder. Rejecting that identity check
# rejects the claim: assessment is cancelled.
# Complete the assessment with "accept" to capture settlement details and open
# approval. Complete it with "decline" to notify the claimant and cancel approval.
# Approval follows a chain on the claim amount: the ClaimsAssessor approves up to
# 20000, the ClaimsManager up to 100000, and the ClaimsCommittee the rest.
# Complete approval with "approved" to pay. Reject approval to notify the decline
# and cancel payment. Any other approval outcome cancels both payment and the notice.
# A missed deadline moves approval one level up the chain.
#
# Roles are the participant role strings. VERIFY_POLICY calls
# IdentityVerificationService. SETTLE calls PaymentGateway.

DEFINITION
INS_CLAIM|Insurance Claim|1

WORKITEMS
process|CLAIM|-|Insurance Claim
process|LODGEMENT|CLAIM|Claim Lodgement
task|LODGE|LODGEMENT|Lodge Claim
task|VERIFY_POLICY|LODGEMENT|Verify Policyholder
process|ASSESSMENT|CLAIM|Claim Assessment
task|ASSESS_CLAIM|ASSESSMENT|Assess Claim
task|COLLECT|ASSESSMENT|Capture Settlement Details
task|APPROVE_CLAIM|ASSESSMENT|Approve Settlement
task|SETTLE|ASSESSMENT|Pay Settlement
task|DECLINE_NOTICE|ASSESSMENT|Notify Decline

DEPENDENCIES
LODGE|VERIFY_POLICY|*
LODGEMENT|ASSESSMENT|*
ASSESS_CLAIM|COLLECT|accept
ASSESS_CLAIM|DECLINE_NOTICE|decline
COLLECT|APPROVE_CLAIM|*
APPROVE_CLAIM|SETTLE|approved
APPROVE_CLAIM|DECLINE_NOTICE|rejected

ROUTING
LODGE|role|ClaimsClerk
VERIFY_POLICY|role|ClaimsClerk
ASSESS_CLAIM|role|ClaimsAssessor
COLLECT|role|ClaimsClerk
APPROVE_CLAIM|approval|amount|ClaimsAssessor|20000|ClaimsManager|100000|ClaimsCommittee
SETTLE|role|ClaimsClerk
DECLINE_NOTICE|role|ClaimsClerk

SERVICES
service|VERIFY_POLICY|IdentityVerificationService
service|SETTLE|PaymentGateway

EXTRAS
checkpoint|VERIFY_POLICY
checkpoint|SETTLE
priority|SETTLE|2
audit|ASSESS_CLAIM
audit|APPROVE_CLAIM
deadline|APPROVE_CLAIM|72
